  40++EC06 21 E0 EB     SelectFlagSlot: LD HL, SlotFlagCache-1
  41++EC09 11 DF 9F                     LD DE, FSpaceObject - Memory.Station
  42++EC0C A7                           AND A
  43++EC0D FD 19                        ADD IY, DE
  44++EC0F 23           AdvanceFlag:    INC HL
  45++EC10 11 D9 FF                     LD DE, -FSpaceObject
